@title 3D Heat: Shell setup in Vents and fans, model words visible without hovering
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Lane H7. The Shell section of Vents and fans: material, wall, paint, insulation, door frame, window, plate gap. Every value says where it came from (assumed at the start), and the section says "Model, not measurement" on the screen. Changing a value turns it into "typed by you".
open_starter_example
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
scroll 170 560 -800
wait 20
expect "Shell"
expect "Model, not measurement"
expect "assumed"
shot shell-defaults
check_layout
click_text "Door frame"
wait 10
expect "typed by you"
shot shell-door-typed
check_layout
